      "start": 535.31,
      "end": 537.03,
      "en": "Well, let's get going then.",
      "zh": "那我们出发吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 537.35,
      "end": 538.41,
      "en": "I love road trips.",
      "zh": "我喜欢自驾游。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 554.25,
      "end": 555.67,
      "en": "Do you think we can make a pit stop?",
      "zh": "我们能中途停一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 556.15,
      "end": 557.85,
      "en": "But we've only been on the road for 10 minutes.",
      "zh": "可我们上路才十分钟啊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 558.35,
      "end": 561.27,
      "en": "I know, but I forgot to go to the bathroom before we left.",
      "zh": "我知道，但在我们离开之前我忘了去洗手间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 565.78,
      "end": 568.68,
      "en": "So, Erika, you said you've been on a million road trips.",
      "zh": "所以，埃里卡，你说你经历过一百万次公路旅行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 568.88,
      "end": 570.0,
      "en": "What was that all about?",
      "zh": "那是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 570.0,
      "end": 570.46,
      "en": "Where have you been?",
      "zh": "你去哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 570.78,
      "end": 574.84,
      "en": "Okay, well, maybe not a million road trips, but many road trips.",
      "zh": "好吧，也许不是一百万次公路旅行，而是许多公路旅行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 575.14,
      "end": 586.36,
      "en": "Every summer I used to go on a road trip with my family, and we would drive many, many hours, probably eight hours in one day, up to northern Canada.",
      "zh": "每年夏天我都会和家人去自驾旅行，一天开上八个小时，一路开到加拿大北部。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 586.62,
      "end": 587.56,
      "en": "Oh, wow, nice.",
      "zh": "哦，哇，不错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 587.92,
      "end": 593.84,
      "en": "Yeah, and then we would go camping, and we would sleep outside, and we would have a campfire at night.",
      "zh": "是的，然后我们会去露营，我们会在外面睡觉，晚上我们会生篝火。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 594.44,
      "end": 595.44,
      "en": "It was great.",
      "zh": "很棒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 595.44,
      "end": 596.0,
      "en": "Ah, family road trip.",
      "zh": "啊，家庭公路旅行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 596.44,
      "end": 599.48,
      "en": "Yeah, but maybe eight hours in a car is a little too long.",
      "zh": "是的，但也许在车里八个小时有点太长了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 599.76,
      "end": 600.12,
      "en": "Well, yeah.",
      "zh": "嗯，是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 600.76,
      "end": 605.0,
      "en": "Well, I've been on a different kind of road trip with some buddies of mine, some friends.",
      "zh": "好吧，我和我的一些朋友，一些朋友进行了一次不同的公路旅行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 605.64,
      "end": 607.16,
      "en": "We would drive to Las Vegas.",
      "zh": "我们会开车去拉斯维加斯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 607.68,
      "end": 607.92,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 608.68,
      "end": 609.68,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 609.68,
      "end": 610.0,
      "en": "So that's really fun.",
      "zh": "所以这真的很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 610.68,
      "end": 616.6,
      "en": "A bunch of crazy guys in a car going to Las Vegas, and then just having fun and talking about everything.",
      "zh": "一群人开着车去拉斯维加斯，一路玩闹、什么都聊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 617.16,
      "end": 620.72,
      "en": "So that's a much different experience than a family road trip.",
      "zh": "因此，这与家庭公路旅行截然不同。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 620.72,
      "end": 621.92,
      "en": "Maybe that sounds a little bit more fun.",
      "zh": "也许这听起来更有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 622.44,
      "end": 625.86,
      "en": "Yeah, eight hours in a car is not really that boring with all your friends.",
      "zh": "是啊，和朋友们一起，在车里待八个小时其实也没那么无聊。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 626.32,
      "end": 633.64,
      "en": "All right, folks, we're out of time for today, but be sure to visit our website at EnglishPod.com and leave all your questions and comments.",
      "zh": "好吧，伙计们，我们今天没有时间了，但请务必访问我们的网站 englishpod.com 并留下您的所有问题和意见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 633.92,
      "end": 638.04,
      "en": "Okay, well, thanks for listening, and until next time, goodbye.",
      "zh": "好的，谢谢你的收听，直到下一次，再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 638.04,
      "end": 647.2,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
